ACTUALLY apply the strip91() helper in /app/frontend/src/pages/Profile.jsx. Suggested implementation:
```js
const strip91 = (p) => {
  if (!p) return "";
  const s = String(p).trim();
  if (s.startsWith("+91")) return s.slice(3).replace(/\D/g, "");
  const digits = s.replace(/\D/g, "");
  if (digits.length === 12 && digits.startsWith("91")) return digits.slice(2);
  return digits.slice(-10); // safest: keep last 10
};
```
Then replace the three regex call-sites at L217, L291, L514 with `strip91(form.phone || user?.phone)` / `strip91(form.phone)` / `strip91(user.phone)` respectively.
